                                                "sense_id": "618feb96-9c6b-3083-9deb-6204b48deb18",
                                                "text": "Our men, though quite expos'd, and though the Glacis was all escarp'd upon the live Rock, went on with an undaunted Courage"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
